{"text": "Christine stared at the bread mixture in the bowl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ugh, This is not working. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Christine shouted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wanted to bake some bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the mixture would not rise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She checked the recipe again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But did not know what went wrong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Christine sighed loudly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And pushed the bowl away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why will this not work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said with a frown. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Seeing her struggle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Christines father offered some advice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Try adding a little more baking powder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He suggested. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Christine followed his advice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And added another spoonful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After only a few minutes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The mixture began to rise. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Christines eyes widened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And her heart began pounding. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It finally works. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She exclaimed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Christine eagerly poured the mixture into a pan. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And placed it in the oven. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This bread will be delicious.", "alignment": {"characters": ["C", "h", "r", "i", "s", "t", "i", "n", "e", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "r", "e", "a", "d", " ", "m", "i", "x", "t", "u", "r", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "w", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "U", "g", "h", ",", " ", "T", "h", "i", "s", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "C", "h",